 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's a common problem. One hack is draw a single eye first, and then the second eye lines up on its own. Try drawing the eye with the top line already there. Then add the bottom lid and the eye will pop out at the right level. For the nose, draw a single line from eye to cheek. The nostril usually follows. Enjoy the feeling of achievement when you nail it. Even simple drawings look great when they' neat and detailed.",
